WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.980
Attendance: recent sessions and attendance, plus each teacher's own attendance link.

2
00:00:07.534 --> 00:00:13.950
Open a session, mark each person (or "All present") and click "Save attendance".

3
00:00:14.504 --> 00:00:20.220
Under "Teacher links", copy each teacher's link and send it so they take attendance themselves.

4
00:00:20.768 --> 00:00:26.400
With "Tell the guardian about an absence" on, guardians are told about absences automatically.

5
00:00:26.953 --> 00:00:33.530
Give a teacher's link only to them; if it leaks, make a "New link" so the old one stops working.
